    "兼容接口示例：https://服务地址/v1。密钥保存在系统钥匙串，仅用于当前服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For compatible APIs, use https://your-service/v1. Keys are stored in Keychain and used only for this service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兼容接口示例：https://服务地址/v1。密钥保存在系统钥匙串，仅用于当前服务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
