    },
    "此操作会在普通收藏中添加或移除下面的网址，退出私密浏览后仍然保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This adds or removes the URL below in your regular bookmarks. The change remains after private browsing ends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会在普通收藏中添加或移除下面的网址，退出私密浏览后仍然保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作會在一般書籤中新增或移除下方網址，退出私密瀏覽後仍然保留。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Aktion fügt die folgende Adresse zu normalen Lesezeichen hinzu oder entfernt sie. Die Änderung bleibt nach dem privaten Surfen erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto añade o elimina la URL siguiente de los marcadores normales. El cambio se conserva al salir de la navegación privada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action ajoute ou retire l’URL ci-dessous des favoris normaux. La modification persiste après la navigation privée."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tindakan ini menambah atau menghapus URL berikut dari markah biasa. Perubahan tetap tersimpan setelah penjelajahan pribadi berakhir."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa azione aggiunge o rimuove l’URL seguente dai preferiti normali. La modifica resta dopo la navigazione privata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下のURLを通常のブックマークに追加または削除します。変更はプライベートブラウズ終了後も保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아래 URL을 일반 북마크에 추가하거나 제거합니다. 변경 사항은 비공개 탐색을 종료한 후에도 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tindakan ini menambah atau membuang URL di bawah daripada penanda buku biasa. Perubahan kekal selepas pelayaran peribadi tamat."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta ação adiciona ou remove o URL abaixo dos marcadores normais. A alteração mantém-se após terminar a navegação privada."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การดำเนินการนี้จะเพิ่มหรือลบ URL ด้านล่างในบุ๊กมาร์กปกติ การเปลี่ยนแปลงจะคงอยู่หลังออกจากการท่องเว็บส่วนตัว"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thao tác này thêm hoặc xóa URL bên dưới trong dấu trang thông thường. Thay đổi vẫn được giữ sau khi thoát chế độ riêng tư."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作会把选定的私密网址保存为普通工作区，关闭私密标签后仍保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This saves the selected private URLs as a normal workspace, which remains after private tabs are closed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会把选定的私密网址保存为普通工作区，关闭私密标签后仍保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作會把選定的私密網址保存為普通工作區，關閉私密標籤後仍保留。"
