    "当前页尚未提交的输入可能丢失。此操作用于应用规则或移除已运行脚本的页面效果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsent input may be lost. Reloading applies rules and removes existing script effects."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前页尚未提交的输入可能丢失。此操作用于应用规则或移除已运行脚本的页面效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
